# the Chords page (EDIT tapped): KNOB 1 the slot, the keys its root (an empty slot: a minor chord), KNOB 2 its
# kind, KNOB 3 its type, KNOB 4 Play; EDIT again: back; EDIT held: the next chord; kept by the piece
listen
wait 3000
tap EDIT
wait 400
expect view 15
said Chords page: Slot 1, Chord Empty, Type Triad, Play Random
tapkey w0
wait 200
said Fm
expect par64 5
expect par72 2
expect par88 1
spin K3 2
wait 200
said Type 7
turn K1 1
wait 200
tapkey b2
wait 200
said Bbm
spin K2 -1
wait 200
said Chord Major
expect par73 1
spin K4 -1
wait 200
expect par88 0
said Play Random
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect par88 1
tap EDIT
wait 300
expect view 0
press EDIT
wait 700
release EDIT
wait 200
said NEXT CHORD
tap PLAY
wait 6000
expect store_writes >0
reboot
wait 1000
expect par64 5
expect par72 2
expect par80 2
expect par65 10
expect par73 1
expect par88 1
